{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgf91CYTA6HRmcWSLNePg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The deliverables and the four feedback sections are done, and I've nothing further to change. Three gaps cannot be closed from this environment:\n\n- **50-title brainstorm:** my list had 51 entries, so the pick came from 51. Redoing it would be a re-roll. The credits disclose the miscount.\n- **Voice check and real hardware:** the gibberish voices were never heard, because the headless browser has no sound. There was no real controller and no real iOS Safari run. The game was tested with a mocked DualSense and touch emulation instead.\n- **Viewports:** the full 13-viewport matrix only showed the title screen. The gameplay scenes were checked at five other sizes, with no JS errors.\n\nThe bundle is in the folder root as `Burn Notice Pending-The Wire (2002-2008) - Keep it as gritty and real as the show-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261102-181334.html`. `exit-interview.json` sits beside it and parses with every field filled in. The Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections are in my previous reply and in the in-game About & Credits screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2396,"cache_read_input_tokens":284259,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2396,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2ae8259-5c55-47b1-bacf-f99cf4152c08","uuid":"92836779-bb43-45d2-b442-59bfdb391359","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:37:30.578Z","request_id":"req_011Cgf91C7ANnrTrqNTA6UhY"}
