{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgf9FdLbYGq414Z2BNqTE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked the voice code, not the sound: typing a line fires a note for about every other letter, and the pitch changes with the letter. In a test, 14 notes came out with 8 distinct pitches, and spaces and punctuation play silent notes. The waveform follows the speaker; this test line used the default (triangle) voice, and I didn't check the other nine speakers. I still have not heard it, because the headless browser has no sound output.\n\nThe \"done when\" terms are met: the bundled HTML is in the folder root, `exit-interview.json` parses with every field filled, and the four sections are in my previous message in full. A search of the source found no TODOs, placeholders or stubs.\n\nWhat remains is outside what I can verify here: a real controller, real iOS Safari, and listening to the voices. The 13-viewport matrix only captured the title screen; gameplay ran at five sizes with no JS errors. The title was picked over a list the code checked at exactly 50 distinct titles, and the first 51-entry list was discarded."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":853,"cache_read_input_tokens":310043,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":853,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":325,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2ae8259-5c55-47b1-bacf-f99cf4152c08","uuid":"4ed0e51a-b9ac-4f83-a970-126d3e6796ff","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:40:46.367Z","request_id":"req_011Cgf9Fcu4Gt2g9TEckv2Ep"}
